stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n<path d=\"M18.5 18L10.5 10\" stroke=\"#F4F4F4\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n</svg></div></div><div class=\"check_wrapper is-last\"><div data-w-id=\"63c8f4ef-7b6e-5580-e762-5a093b6fdece\" class=\"is-check-icon w-embed\"><svg width=\"29\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 29 28\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<circle cx=\"14.5\" cy=\"14\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#DA3636\" fill-opacity=\"0.5\"/>\n<path d=\"M18.5 10L10.5 18\" stroke=\"#F4F4F4\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n<path d=\"M18.5 18L10.5 10\" stroke=\"#F4F4F4\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n</svg></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><section class=\"section_faq\"><div class=\"padding-global\"><div class=\"container-large\"><div class=\"padding-section-small\"><div class=\"w-layout-grid faq_component\"><div id=\"w-node-_5a31291e-162b-f670-ef0e-8db7cfb23e18-cfb23e13\" class=\"faq_content\"><h2 data-prevent-flicker=\"true\" data-line-reveal=\"true\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2></div><div class=\"faq_list\"><div data-w-id=\"931ac54a-c39d-3b08-5a8d-394d3b834c70\" class=\"faq_accordion\"><div class=\"faq_question\"><div class=\"text-weight-bold\">Do I need a privacy policy for my website to be legally compliant?<br/></div><div class=\"faq_icon-wrapper\"><div class=\"is-faq_icon w-embed\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 13\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M12 6.9707L10.9387 5.90945L6.75 10.0982L6.75 0.970703L5.25 0.970703L5.25 10.0982L1.06125 5.90945L-2.62268e-07 6.9707L6 12.9707L12 6.9707Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n</svg></div></div></div><div class=\"faq_answer\"><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-small\"><div class=\"margin-top margin-xxsmall\"><p>Yes. If your website collects any personal data, such as names, email addresses, IPs, or uses cookies - you are legally required to have a privacy policy. Privacy policies for websites are essential to comply with data protection laws like GDPR, CCPA, and others. At CraftPolicy, we create lawyer-crafted privacy policies tailored to your business, ensuring full compliance and building trust with your users.<br/></p></div></div></div></div><div data-w-id=\"931ac54a-c39d-3b08-5a8d-394d3b834c70\" class=\"faq_accordion\"><div class=\"faq_question\"><div class=\"text-weight-bold\">Why Generic Privacy Policies for Websites Put You at Risk?</div><div class=\"faq_icon-wrapper\"><div class=\"is-faq_icon w-embed\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 13\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M12 6.9707L10.9387 5.90945L6.75 10.0982L6.75 0.970703L5.25 0.970703L5.25 10.0982L1.06125 5.90945L-2.62268e-07 6.9707L6 12.9707L12 6.9707Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n</svg></div></div></div><div class=\"faq_answer\"><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-small\"><div class=\"margin-top margin-xxsmall\"><p>Generic templates often fail to meet legal requirements because they aren’t tailored to your business, your data practices, or the laws that apply to you. Many free or one-size-fits-all privacy policies for websites miss key legal details, such as how you collect data, use third-party tools, handle international transfers, or meet GDPR and CCPA requirements.<br/>For instance, under the GDPR, businesses can face fines of up to €20 million or 4% of annual global revenue, whichever is higher, for non-compliance.<br/>Using an incomplete or outdated template puts your business at risk of legal penalties, loss of customer trust, and reputational damage. At CraftPolicy, we create lawyer-crafted privacy policies tailored to your specific website and data practices — helping you stay compliant and protected.<br/></p></div></div></div></div><div data-w-id=\"931ac54a-c39d-3b08-5a8d-394d3b834c70\" class=\"faq_accordion\"><div class=\"faq_question\"><div class=\"text-weight-bold\">How long will it take to complete my legal documents?</div><div class=\"faq_icon-wrapper\"><div class=\"is-faq_icon w-embed\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 13\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M12 6.9707L10.9387 5.90945L6.75 10.0982L6.75 0.970703L5.25 0.970703L5.25 10.0982L1.06125 5.90945L-2.62268e-07 6.9707L6 12.9707L12 6.9707Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n</svg></div></div></div><div class=\"faq_answer\"><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-small\"><div class=\"margin-top margin-xxsmall\"><p>During your free consultation, we’ll review your needs and the complexity of your request—whether it’s a privacy policy, cookie policy, or data protection agreement. Based on this, we’ll provide a clear estimated completion date and pricing as part of your personalized proposal. This ensures transparency and helps you plan for compliance with privacy regulations and legal policies from the start.<br/></p></div></div></div></div><div data-w-id=\"931ac54a-c39d-3b08-5a8d-394d3b834c70\" class=\"faq_accordion\"><div class=\"faq_question\"><div class=\"text-weight-bold\">Do you offer any ongoing legal support after the document is delivered?<br/></div><div class=\"faq_icon-wrapper\"><div class=\"is-faq_icon w-embed\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 13\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M12 6.9707L10.9387 5.90945L6.75 10.0982L6.75 0.970703L5.25 0.970703L5.25 10.0982L1.06125 5.90945L-2.62268e-07 6.9707L6 12.9707L12 6.9707Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n</svg></div></div></div><div class=\"faq_answer\"><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-small\"><div class=\"margin-top margin-xxsmall\"><p>We believe in building lasting partnerships with our clients. While our core focus is crafting custom legal documents, such as privacy policies, data protection agreements, and terms &amp; conditions, we also offer optional ongoing legal support packages. These are ideal for businesses needing continued guidance on privacy compliance, data protection services, or evolving GDPR compliance solutions.<br/></p></div></div></div></div><div data-w-id=\"931ac54a-c39d-3b08-5a8d-394d3b834c70\" class=\"faq_accordion\"><div class=\"faq_question\"><div class=\"text-weight-bold\">What types of legal documents do you craft?<br/></div><div class=\"faq_icon-wrapper\"><div class=\"is-faq_icon w-embed\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 13\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M12 6.9707L10.9387 5.90945L6.75 10.0982L6.75 0.970703L5.25 0.970703L5.25 10.0982L1.06125 5.90945L-2.62268e-07 6.9707L6 12.9707L12 6.9707Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n</svg></div></div></div><div class=\"faq_answer\"><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-small\"><div class=\"margin-top margin-xxsmall\"><p>At CraftPolicy, we specialize in crafting custom-tailored legal documents for startups and tech companies. This includes essential documents for your website, e-commerce store, or mobile app, ensuring your online presence is legally compliant and protects both you and your users. <br/></p></div></div></div></div><div data-w-id=\"931ac54a-c39d-3b08-5a8d-394d3b834c70\" class=\"faq_accordion\"><div class=\"faq_question\"><div class=\"text-weight-bold\">What happens if I need to make changes to my document after it&#x27;s finalized? <br/></div><div class=\"faq_icon-wrapper\"><div class=\"is-faq_icon w-embed\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 13\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M12 6.9707L10.9387 5.90945L6.75 10.0982L6.75 0.970703L5.25 0.970703L5.25 10.0982L1.06125 5.90945L-2.62268e-07 6.9707L6 12.9707L12 6.9707Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n</svg></div></div></div><div class=\"faq_answer\"><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-small\"><div class=\"margin-top margin-xxsmall\"><p>We understand that legal requirements and business models evolve. Whether it&#x27;s an update to your privacy policy, cookie policy, or DPA, we offer flexible revision options. Our team will work with you to ensure ongoing compliance with data protection laws and keep your legal documents aligned with your business as it grows.<br/></p></div></div></div></div><div data-w-id=\"931ac54a-c39d-3b08-5a8d-394d3b834c70\" class=\"faq_accordion\"><div class=\"faq_question\"><div class=\"text-weight-bold\">How do you stay up to date on the latest legal developments concerning tech and online businesses?<br/></div><div class=\"faq_icon-wrapper\"><div class=\"is-faq_icon w-embed\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 13\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M12 6.9707L10.9387 5.90945L6.75 10.0982L6.75 0.970703L5.25 0.970703L5.25 10.0982L1.06125 5.90945L-2.62268e-07 6.9707L6 12.9707L12 6.9707Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n</svg></div></div></div><div class=\"faq_answer\"><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-small\"><div class=\"margin-top margin-xxsmall\"><p>Our legal team stays current by monitoring changes in global privacy laws, including GDPR, CCPA, and other data protection regulations. We actively follow developments in digital law services, attend industry events, and engage in ongoing legal education. This ensures your legal policies and data compliance services are always based on the latest standards.<br/></p></div></div></div></div><div data-w-id=\"931ac54a-c39d-3b08-5a8d-394d3b834c70\" class=\"faq_accordion\"><div class=\"faq_question\"><div class=\"text-weight-bold\">How do you ensure the security and confidentiality of my information?</div><div class=\"faq_icon-wrapper\"><div class=\"is-faq_icon w-embed\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 13\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M12 6.9707L10.9387 5.90945L6.75 10.0982L6.75 0.970703L5.25 0.970703L5.25 10.0982L1.06125 5.90945L-2.62268e-07 6.9707L6 12.9707L12 6.9707Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n</svg></div></div></div><div class=\"faq_answer\"><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-small\"><div class=\"margin-top margin-xxsmall\"><p>We take data security seriously and employ robust security measures, including data encryption, strict access controls, and regular audits, to guarantee that your data remains secure and confidential. Additionally, we adhere to the highest ethical and professional standards regarding client confidentiality.<br/></p></div></div></div></div><div data-w-id=\"931ac54a-c39d-3b08-5a8d-394d3b834c70\" class=\"faq_accordion\"><div class=\"faq_question\"><div class=\"text-weight-bold\"><strong>Do you offer legal compliance solutions beyond privacy policies?</strong></div><div class=\"faq_icon-wrapper\"><div class=\"is-faq_icon w-embed\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 13\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M12 6.9707L10.9387 5.90945L6.75 10.0982L6.75 0.970703L5.25 0.970703L5.25 10.0982L1.06125 5.90945L-2.62268e-07 6.9707L6 12.9707L12 6.9707Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n</svg></div></div></div><div class=\"faq_answer\"><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-small\"><div class=\"margin-top margin-xxsmall\"><p>Yes. In addition to our privacy policy services, CraftPolicy provides a full range of legal compliance solutions for online businesses. This includes terms &amp; conditions, cookie policies, data processing agreements (DPAs), and support with GDPR consultancy, data compliance services, and custom legal documents. Whether you need a one-time document or guidance from a GDPR expert, our team ensures your business meets all regulatory requirements with precision and clarity.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-w-id=\"931ac54a-c39d-3b08-5a8d-394d3b834c70\" class=\"faq_accordion\"><div class=\"faq_question\"><div class=\"text-weight-bold\"><strong>What is your approach to communicating with clients throughout the legal document creation process?</strong></div><div class=\"faq_icon-wrapper\"><div class=\"is-faq_icon w-embed\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 13\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M12 6.9707L10.9387 5.90945L6.75 10.0982L6.75 0.970703L5.25 0.970703L5.25 10.0982L1.06125 5.90945L-2.62268e-07 6.9707L6 12.9707L12 6.9707Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n</svg></div></div></div><div class=\"faq_answer\"><div class=\"margin-bottom margin-small\"><div class=\"margin-top margin-xxsmall\"><p>We prioritize transparent and consistent communication throughout your journey with CraftPolicy. While we prioritize written communication for clarity and record-keeping, we are always open to accommodating your preferred communication methods whenever possible.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-faq\"><div class=\"is-faq_background-element is-home w-embed\"><svg width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 598 595\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M248.684 0C186.323 9.46347 132.066 37.3153 85.913 83.5556C28.6376 140.939 0 211.537 0 295.347C0 379.158 28.6376 450.133 85.913 508.271C143.942 565.655 214.783 594.347 298.435 594.347C382.087 594.347 452.927 565.655 510.956 508.271C568.985 450.133 598 379.158 598 295.347C598 266.204 594.492 238.658 587.475 212.71C581.435 217.007 574.881 220.769 567.849 223.9C517.918 246.134 460.474 229.194 429.975 186.303C429.144 186.693 428.307 187.076 427.464 187.452C358.083 218.347 276.794 187.148 245.899 117.768C228.443 78.5677 230.809 35.5661 248.684 0ZM182.769 361.702C218.464 345.807 234.515 303.985 218.62 268.29C202.725 232.595 160.903 216.544 125.208 232.439C89.5126 248.334 73.4615 290.156 89.3565 325.851C105.251 361.546 147.073 377.597 182.769 361.702ZM487.575 343.821C499.861 371.414 487.454 403.742 459.861 416.029C432.269 428.316 399.94 415.909 387.653 388.316C375.366 360.724 387.774 328.395 415.366 316.108C442.959 303.821 475.288 316.229 487.575 343.821ZM293.5 518.915C314.413 509.602 323.817 485.099 314.504 464.186C305.192 443.273 280.689 433.869 259.776 443.181C238.862 452.494 229.458 476.997 238.771 497.91C248.084 518.823 272.586 528.227 293.5 518.915Z\" fill=\"url(#paint0_linear_1490_11730)\"/>\n<defs>\n<linearGradient id=\"paint0_linear_1490_11730\" x1=\"401.866\" y1=\"-45.587\" x2=\"95.6102\" y2=\"575.836\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\n<stop stop-color=\"#0075FF\" stop-opacity=\"0\"/>\n<stop offset=\"0.9999\" stop-color=\"#0075FF\" stop-opacity=\"0.1\"/>\n</linearGradient>\n</defs>\n</svg></div></div></section><div class=\"section_cta\"><div class=\"padding-global\"><div class=\"container-large\"><div class=\"padding-section-small\"><div class=\"cta-content_wrapper\"><div class=\"heading-cta_wrapper\"><div class=\"max-width-large is-smaller\"><h2 class=\"max-width-medium is-bigger-cta\">Simplify Privacy Compliance with Lawyer-Crafted Legal Policies.</h2></div><a data-w-id=\"d470ebaf-8ab6-2407-f9c3-27d1563e9c71\" style=\"background-color:rgb(1,117,255)\" href=\"/contact-us\" class=\"button is-small is-icon is-medium w-inline-block\"><div class=\"text-btn\">Book a Free Consultation</div><div style=\"-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0, 0)\" class=\"icon-embed-xsmall w-embed\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M1.24264 0.272069V1.7729H7.16643L0.712311 8.22702L1.77297 9.28768L8.22709 2.83356L8.22709 8.75735L9.72792 8.75735V0.272069H1.24264Z\" fill=\"#F4F4F4\"/>\n</svg></div></a></div><div class=\"is-cta_cookie w-embed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 101 103\" fill=\"none\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"img\">\n<path fil