kie Consent Service</div></a><a aria-label=\"Website-Cookie-Policy-link\" href=\"/services/gdpr-implementation/cookie-implement\" class=\"footer_link w-inline-block\"><div>Website Cookie Policy</div></a><div href=\"#\" class=\"footer_link\"><div class=\"text-size-regular text-weight-medium\">GDPR Implementation resources</div></div><a aria-label=\"Accurate-GDPR-Compliance-link\" href=\"/document-preparation\" class=\"footer_link w-inline-block\"><div>Accurate GDPR Compliance Documents for Your Business</div></a><a aria-label=\"Professional-Cookie-Policies-Services-link\" href=\"/cookie-policies\" class=\"footer_link w-inline-block\"><div>Professional Cookie Policies Services</div></a></div><div class=\"page-links_wrapper\"><a href=\"/services/privacy-and-data\" aria-label=\"Data-Privacy-Services-link\" class=\"footer_link is-main w-inline-block\"><div class=\"text-size-regular text-weight-medium\">Data Privacy Services</div></a><a aria-label=\"Compliance-Consulting-Services-link\" href=\"/services/privacy-and-data/website-privacy-audit\" class=\"footer_link w-inline-block\"><div>Compliance Consulting Services</div></a><a aria-label=\"Data-Protection-Policy-link\" href=\"/services/privacy-and-data/data-protection-policy\" class=\"footer_link w-inline-block\"><div>Data Protection Policy</div></a></div><div class=\"resources-pages_wrapper\"><div class=\"pages_wrapper\"><div class=\"text-size-medium text-weight-medium is-white\"><div>Resources</div></div><div class=\"page-links_wrapper-copy\"><a href=\"/case-studies\" aria-label=\"Case-Studies-link\" class=\"footer_link w-inline-block\"><div>Case Studies</div></a><a href=\"/faqs\" aria-label=\"FAQ-link\" class=\"footer_link w-inline-block\"><div>FAQs</div></a></div></div><div class=\"pages_wrapper is-hidden\"><div class=\"text-size-medium text-weight-medium is-white\"><div>Company</div></div><div class=\"page-links_wrapper-copy\"><a aria-label=\"partnership-link\" href=\"/partnerships\" class=\"footer_link w-inline-block\"><div>Partnership</div></a><a aria-label=\"about-us-link\" href=\"/about-us\" class=\"footer_link w-inline-block\"><div>About us</div></a><a aria-label=\"contact-us-link\" href=\"/contact-us\" class=\"footer_link w-inline-block\"><div>Contact us</div></a></div></div><div class=\"pages_wrapper is-hidden\"><div class=\"text-size-medium text-weight-medium is-white\"><div>Legal</div></div><div class=\"page-links_wrapper-copy\"><a aria-label=\"terms-conditions-link\" href=\"/legal/terms-conditions\" class=\"footer_link w-inline-block\"><div>Terms &amp; Conditions</div></a><a aria-label=\"cookie-policy-link\" href=\"/legal/cookie-policy\" class=\"footer_link w-inline-block\"><div>Cookie Policy</div></a><a aria-label=\"privacy-policy-link\" href=\"/legal/privacy-policy\" class=\"footer_link w-inline-block\"><div>Privacy Policy</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"signature-wrapper text-size-small\"><div>© 2025 CraftPolicy. All Rights Reserved.</div><div>Design and Development: <a href=\"https://www.creativecorner.studio/\" aria-label=\"creative-corner-studio-link\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"footer_link\">Creative Corner Studio</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></main></div><script src=\"https://d3e54v103j8qbb.cloudfront.net/js/jquery-3.5.1.min.dc5e7f18c8.js?site=682f5a25d5391b32b471c91f\" type=\"text/javascript\" integrity=\"sha256-9/aliU8dGd2tb6OSsuzixeV4y/faTqgFtohetphbbj0=\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script><script src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/682f5a25d5391b32b471c91f/js/craft-policy.schunk.36b8fb49256177c8.js\" type=\"text/javascript\"></script><script src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/682f5a25d5391b32b471c91f/js/craft-policy.schunk.6785f6dc779e9733.js\" type=\"text/javascript\"></script><script src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/682f5a25d5391b32b471c91f/js/craft-policy.839ae247.72b2ecf7029fe7fc.js\" type=\"text/javascript\"></script><script src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/gsap/3.14.2/gsap.min.js\" type=\"text/javascript\"></script><script src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/gsap/3.14.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\" type=\"text/javascript\"></script><script src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/gsap/3.14.2/SplitText.min.js\" type=\"text/javascript\"></script><script type=\"text/javascript\">gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger,SplitText);</script>\n<!-- Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->\n<noscript><iframe src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/ns.html?id=GTM-538R3C84\"\nheight=\"0\" width=\"0\" style=\"display:none;visibility:hidden\"></iframe></noscript>\n<!-- End Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->\n\n\n\n<script>\ndocument.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n\tif (typeof window.gsap === \"undefined\") document.documentElement.classList.add(\"gsap-not-found\");\n\tgsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger, SplitText);\n});\n</script>\n\n\n\n<script>\n  document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", function () {\n    const navbar = document.querySelector(\".navbar_component\");\n    const menuBtn = document.querySelector(\".w-nav-button\");\n    const navMenu = document.querySelector(\".w-nav-menu\");\n\n    if (!navbar || !menuBtn || !navMenu) {\n      console.warn(\"Missing element(s)\", { navbar, menuBtn, navMenu });\n      return;\n    }\n\n    function isMobileMenuOpen() {\n      // Webflow sets display:block when menu is open on mobile/tablet\n      const isMenuVisible = window.getComputedStyle(menuBtn).display !== \"none\";\n      const isMenuOpen = window.getComputedStyle(navMenu).display !== \"none\";\n      return isMenuVisible && isMenuOpen;\n    }\n\n    function updateNavbar() {\n      const isScrolled = window.scrollY > 0;\n\n      if (isScrolled || isMobileMenuOpen()) {\n        navbar.classList.add(\"scrolled\");\n      } else {\n        navbar.classList.remove(\"scrolled\");\n      }\n    }\n\n    window.addEventListener(\"scroll\", updateNavbar);\n\n    menuBtn.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      setTimeout(updateNavbar, 200); // Let Webflow toggle classes/styles\n    });\n\n    // Initial state\n    updateNavbar();\n  });\n</script>\n\n\n<style>\n  .navbar_component {\n    background: transparent !important;\n    transition: background 0.3s ease;\n  }\n\n  .navbar_component.scrolled {\n    background: var(--neutral--20) !important;\n  }\n</style>\n\n\n\n\n\n<script>\n  document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", function () {\n    function setupAccordion(containerClass, questionClass, answerClass, textSelector, openBorderColor, defaultBorderColor) {\n      const questions = document.querySelectorAll(`.${questionClass}`);\n\n      questions.forEach((question) => {\n        question.addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n          const parent = question.closest(`.${containerClass}`);\n          const answer = parent.querySelector(`.${answerClass}`);\n          const text = question.querySelector(textSelector);\n          const icon = parent.querySelector(\".is-faq_icon\");\n          const isOpen = parent.classList.contains(\"is-open\");\n\n          document.querySelectorAll(`.${containerClass}.is-open`).forEach((item) => {\n            if (item !== parent) {\n              item.classList.remove(\"is-open\");\n              const itemAnswer = item.querySelector(`.${answerClass}`);\n              const itemText = item.querySelector(`${textSelector}`);\n              const itemIcon = item.querySelector(\".is-faq_icon\");\n\n              if (itemAnswer) itemAnswer.style.maxHeight = \"0px\";\n              if (itemText) itemText.style.fontWeight = \"400\";\n              if (itemIcon) {\n                itemIcon.style.transform = \"rotate(0deg)\";\n                itemIcon.style.color = \"\";\n              }\n              item.style.borderColor = defaultBorderColor;\n            }\n          });\n\n          if (!isOpen) {\n            parent.classList.add(\"is-open\");\n            if (answer) {\n              answer.style.maxHeight = \"0px\";\n              answer.style.overflow = \"hidden\";\n              requestAnimationFrame(() => {\n                answer.style.maxHeight = answer.scrollHeight + \"px\";\n              });\n            }\n            if (text) text.style.fontWeight = \"500\";\n            if (icon) {\n              icon.style.transform = \"rotate(180deg)\";\n              icon.style.color = \"var(--brand-blue--100)\";\n            }\n            parent.style.borderColor = openBorderColor;\n          } else {\n            parent.classList.remove(\"is-open\");\n            if (answer) answer.style.maxHeight = \"0px\";\n            if (text) text.style.fontWeight = \"400\";\n            if (icon) {\n              icon.style.transform = \"rotate(0deg)\";\n              icon.style.color = \"\";\n            }\n            parent.style.borderColor = defaultBorderColor;\n          }\n        });\n      });\n\n      // Open first accordion by default\n      const first = document.querySelector(`.${questionClass}.is-1st`);\n      if (first) {\n        const parent = first.closest(`.${containerClass}`);\n        const answer = parent.querySelector(`.${answerClass}`);\n        const text = first.querySelector(textSelector);\n        const icon = parent.querySelector(\".is-faq_icon\");\n\n        parent.classList.add(\"is-open\");\n        if (answer) answer.style.maxHeight = answer.scrollHeight + \"px\";\n        if (text) text.style.fontWeight = \"500\";\n        if (icon) {\n          icon.style.transform = \"rotate(180deg)\";\n          icon.style.color = \"var(--brand-blue--100)\";\n        }\n        parent.style.borderColor = openBorderColor;\n      }\n    }\n\n    setupAccordion(\n      \"faq_accordion\",\n      \"faq_question\",\n      \"faq_answer\",\n      \".text-size-medium\",\n      \"var(--border-color--border-primary)\",\n      \"rgba(28, 28, 28, 0.1)\"\n    );\n  });\n</script>\n\n<style>\n  /* FAQ Accordion Styles */\n  .faq_accordion {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(28, 28, 28, 0.1);\n    transition: border-color 0.3s ease;\n  }\n\n  .faq_accordion.is-open {\n    border-color: var(--border-color--border-primary);\n  }\n\n  .faq_question {\n    cursor: pointer;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n\n  .faq_answer {\n    max-height: 0;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    transition: max-height 0.5s ease-in-out;\n  }\n\n  .faq_question .text-size-medium {\n    font-weight: 400;\n    transition: font-weight 0.3s ease;\n  }\n\n  .faq_accordion.is-open .faq_question .text-size-medium {\n    font-weight: 500;\n  }\n\n  .is-faq_icon {\n    transition: transform 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;\n  }\n</style>\n\n\n\n\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/swiper@11/swiper-bundle.min.js\"></script>\n\n<script>\n// Vertical swiper for services remains unchanged\nvar mySwiper = new Swiper(\"#swiper-services\", {\n  direction: 'vertical',\n  autoplay: { delay: 0 },\n  speed: 2000,\n  slidesPerGroup: 1,\n  a11y: false,\n  loop: true,\n  slidesPerView: 'auto',\n  grabCursor: true,\n  allowTouchMove: true,\n  freeMode: true,\n});\n</script>\n</body></html>"
          },
          "redirectURL": "",
          "headersSize": -1,
